COMMENT PRESERVATION IN BLOCK MAPS
---
# document header
alpha: 1 # inline alpha
# above beta
beta: # after colon beta
  nested: 10 # inline nested
# above gamma
gamma: 3 # inline gamma
# document footer
---
- [update, [alpha], 2]
- [update, [beta, added], 20]
- [update, [delta], 4]
- [remove, [gamma]]
